    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "So much that",
     "texto": [
      "To say to what extent something is so, use **-(으)ㄹ 정도로** (so much that…, to the point of…): 울다 → **울 정도로** (to the point of crying), 놀라다 → **놀랄 정도로** (so much that it is astonishing), 맛있다 → **맛있을 정도로** (so tasty that).",
      "울 정도로 슬펐어요 = it was so sad that I cried."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With «정도»",
     "texto": [
      "**-(으)ㄹ 정도이다** is the same, but as a verb: 울 정도이다 = it is so that one cries.",
      "It is very common in speech and in writing."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
